te(60,676)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,849)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1334,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-22C5\" x=\"2056\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2557,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-78\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-951)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"1834\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-3294)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>However, there is also another method that we can use, known as the <strong>flip method,</strong> which involves taking the reciprocal of both sides of an equation. So, when an equation involves two fractions, we can \"flip\" them as follows:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"24.174ex\" height=\"5.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1508.9 10408.2 2372\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n\\dfrac{a}{b} = \\dfrac{c}{d}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\dfrac ba =\\dfrac dc\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-62\" d=\"M73 647Q73 657 77 670T89 683Q90 683 161 688T234 694Q246 694 246 685T212 542Q204 508 195 472T180 418L176 399Q176 396 182 402Q231 442 283 442Q345 442 383 396T422 280Q422 169 343 79T173 -11Q123 -11 82 27T40 150V159Q40 180 48 217T97 414Q147 611 147 623T109 637Q104 637 101 637H96Q86 637 83 637T76 640T73 647ZM336 325V331Q336 405 275 405Q258 405 240 397T207 376T181 352T163 330L157 322L136 236Q114 150 114 114Q114 66 138 42Q154 26 178 26Q211 26 245 58Q270 81 285 114T318 219Q336 291 336 325Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-63\" d=\"M34 159Q34 268 120 355T306 442Q362 442 394 418T427 355Q427 326 408 306T360 285Q341 285 330 295T319 325T330 359T352 380T366 386H367Q367 388 361 392T340 400T306 404Q276 404 249 390Q228 381 206 359Q162 315 142 235T121 119Q121 73 147 50Q169 26 205 26H209Q321 26 394 111Q403 121 406 121Q410 121 419 112T429 98T420 83T391 55T346 25T282 0T202 -11Q127 -11 81 37T34 159Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-64\" d=\"M366 683Q367 683 438 688T511 694Q523 694 523 686Q523 679 450 384T375 83T374 68Q374 26 402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487H491Q506 153 506 145Q506 140 503 129Q490 79 473 48T445 8T417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157Q33 205 53 255T101 341Q148 398 195 420T280 442Q336 442 364 400Q369 394 369 396Q370 400 396 505T424 616Q424 629 417 632T378 637H357Q351 643 351 645T353 664Q358 683 366 683ZM352 326Q329 405 277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q233 26 290 98L298 109L352 326Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-27F9\" d=\"M1218 514Q1218 525 1234 525Q1239 525 1242 525T1247 525T1251 524T1253 523T1255 520T1257 517T1260 512Q1297 438 1358 381T1469 300T1565 263Q1582 258 1582 250T1573 239T1536 228T1478 204Q1334 134 1260 -12Q1256 -21 1253 -22T1238 -24Q1218 -24 1218 -17Q1218 -13 1223 0Q1258 69 1309 123L1319 133H70Q56 140 56 153Q56 168 72 173H1363L1373 181Q1412 211 1490 250Q1489 251 1472 259T1427 283T1373 319L1363 327H710L707 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347Q56 360 70 367H1319L1309 377Q1276 412 1247 458T1218 514Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"649\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"60\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"110\" y=\"-715\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1167\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2223,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"643\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-63\" x=\"105\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-64\" x=\"60\" y=\"-715\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-27F9\" x=\"4384\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(7301,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"649\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"110\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"60\" y=\"-686\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"8468\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(9524,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"643\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-64\" x=\"60\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-63\" x=\"105\" y=\"-686\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>The above technique works whenever <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.23ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 529.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">a</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.007ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 433.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">c</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-63\" d=\"M34 159Q34 268 120 355T306 442Q362 442 394 418T427 355Q427 326 408 306T360 285Q341 285 330 295T319 325T330 359T352 380T366 386H367Q367 388 361 392T340 400T306 404Q276 404 249 390Q228 381 206 359Q162 315 142 235T121 119Q121 73 147 50Q169 26 205 26H209Q321 26 394 111Q403 121 406 121Q410 121 419 112T429 98T420 83T391 55T346 25T282 0T202 -11Q127 -11 81 37T34 159Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMATHI-63\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> are both different from zero.</p>\n<p>The flip method is useful because it allows us to remove a variable from a denominator. For example, applying the flip method, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"24.914ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 10726.7 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n\\dfrac{\\color{red}2}{\\color{blue}x}=\\dfrac{\\color{blue}3}{\\color{red}5}  \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\dfrac{\\color{blue}x}{\\color{red}2} = \\dfrac{\\color{red}5}{\\color{blue}3}.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-27F9\" d=\"M1218 514Q1218 525 1234 525Q1239 525 1242 525T1247 525T1251 524T1253 523T1255 520T1257 517T1260 512Q1297 438 1358 381T1469 300T1565 263Q1582 258 1582 250T1573 239T1536 228T1478 204Q1334 134 1260 -12Q1256 -21 1253 -22T1238 -24Q1218 -24 1218 -17Q1218 -13 1223 0Q1258 69 1309 123L1319 133H70Q56 140 56 153Q56 168 72 173H1363L1373 181Q1412 211 1490 250Q1489 251 1472 259T1427 283T1373 319L1363 327H710L707 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347Q56 360 70 367H1319L1309 377Q1276 412 1247 458T1218 514Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"692\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(96,676)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(60,-686)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-78\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1210\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2266,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-27F9\" x=\"4404\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(7321,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"692\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-78\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(96,-687)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"8531\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(9587,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(60,-686)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"10448\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Now, we can solve the resulting equation using the multiplication principle:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"16.085ex\" height=\"17.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -7.88ex; margin-bottom: -0.291ex;\